	"data": "Godot OpenXR Vendors Plugin\n\nVendor plugin exposing Meta, Pico, and other headset-specific features.\nRepo: <https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors>\nLicense: MIT\nGodot version: 4.x (v5.1 current)\nStatus: Actively maintained by Bastiaan Olij, funded by Khronos + Meta\n\nWhat It Provides\nMeta Scene Manager — scan environment, get wall/floor/ceiling meshes\nSpatial Anchors — persistent anchors that survive between sessions\nPassthrough control (color, opacity, blend modes)\nBody tracking (Meta…",
